{"id":"15272312","articleId":"13369898","title":"How to Withdraw","description":"","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"To withdraw funds from your Polymarket account:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"orderedNestedList","text":"1. Go to your Portfolio.\n2. Click <b>Withdraw</b>.\n3. Enter the <b>recipient address</b>.\n4. Select the <b>token</b>, <b>amount</b>, and <b>network (chain)</b>.\n5. Click <b>Withdraw</b> to confirm the transaction.","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Go to your Portfolio.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Click <b>Withdraw</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Enter the <b>recipient address</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Select the <b>token</b>, <b>amount</b>, and <b>network (chain)</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Click <b>Withdraw</b> to confirm the transaction.","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"After the withdrawal is processed, your funds will be sent to the specified address.","class":"no-margin"}],"markdown":null,"author":null,"collectionId":"17859237","targetUserType":"everyone","lastUpdated":"Updated over 7 months ago","lastUpdatedDate":"2026-01-12T17:44:32Z","showTableOfContents":true,"synced":false,"relatedArticles":[{"title":"Recover Missing Deposit","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364241-recover-missing-deposit"},{"title":"How to Sign-Up","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13369877-how-to-sign-up"},{"title":"How to Deposit","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13369887-how-to-deposit"},{"title":"Polymarket Exchange Upgrade: April 28, 2026","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/14762452-polymarket-exchange-upgrade-april-28-2026"},{"title":"How to Delete Your Polymarket Account","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/15458866-how-to-delete-your-polymarket-account"}],"locale":"en","breadcrumbs":[{"url":"https:/